# Pairs with RemovalWinsUnderSkew. An admin-set removal stamped by the local
# clock alone loses the merge to a slot a leading silo or peer wrote.
MODULE: AdminRemovalStampedWithLocalClock
TARGET: RemovalWinsUnderSkew
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the admin-set removal is stamped with the lagging silo's clock
PERTURBS: BeginRemoveAdmin

--- FIND
                   stamp |-> [x \in Sets |-> IF x = "admin" THEN RemovalStamp(clock[s], slots["admin"][e]) ELSE 0],
--- REPLACE
                   stamp |-> [x \in Sets |-> IF x = "admin" THEN clock[s] + 1 ELSE 0],
--- END